{"id":96153864779911,"name":"Scary Grocery: The Night Shift [HORROR]","desc":"Congratulations, you've been hired! 🔥\nWelcome to your first night shift at The Store. 🏪🌙\n\nThe job seems simple:\n\n- Scan customers at the register.\n- Check their info on the screen (name, age, job, location).\n- Ask questions to verify.\n\nReal customer? Checkout. ✅\nDoppelganger? Shoot! 🔫\n\nToss bodies out 💀, mop up messes, restock shelves, buy items. \n\nOh, and one more thing...\nDon't let a doppelganger slip through, or face the entity. 😈\n\nGood luck.\n\nLike & join the group! 👍⭐","path":"/game/96153864779911-scary-grocery-the-night-shift-horror","slug":"96153864779911-scary-grocery-the-night-shift-horror","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-22514723572cb781521f1739b4d622c0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-342f951f20b0438f37582a6b0ac88b50/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":1231,"visitor":103326450,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-06-28T13:57:25.308Z","creator":{"name":"Moo Milk Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Scary-Grocery:-The-Night-Shift-HORROR-Eve-scripts-239868","_id":"6a412845dce036e621a8669d","title":"Eve scripts","game":{"_id":"69b4bc531f961507411b1692","gameId":96153864779911,"name":"Scary Grocery: The Night Shift [HORROR]","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-342f951f20b0438f37582a6b0ac88b50-55ccb1d543ac.png","placeId":96153864779911},"features":"Good","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/n8p0ftch\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a0f6d47acb63953aa47d736","username":"tahap3111","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"6a0f6d47acb63953aa47d736","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"https://jnkie.com/get-key/dika","views":1440,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public